# SecureBank Architecture

## Project
Digital Direct Deposit

## Cloud Provider
Microsoft Azure

## Services
1. Azure App Service
2. Azure SQL Database
3. Azure Storage
4. Azure Service Bus
5. Azure Monitor
6. Log Analytics

## Customer Workflow
1. Customer opens SecureBank.
2. Customer selects a bank account.
3. Customer searches for an employer.
4. Customer submits a direct deposit request.
5. Application stores the demo request.
6. Customer checks request status.

## Purpose
Demonstrate Azure cloud infrastructure,
application hosting, database management,
monitoring and troubleshooting.